---
import '../../styles/homelab/header.css';
import HomelabStatus from './HomelabStatus.astro';
---

<header class="homelab-header">
  <div class="header-top-nav">
    <a href="/" class="back-link">
      <i class="fa-solid fa-arrow-left"></i> Back to Home
    </a>
  </div>

  <div class="header-main-content">
    <div class="header-titles">
      <h1 class="page-title">Homelab Network Diagram</h1>
      <p class="page-subtitle">
        Self-hosted infrastructure and services running at home.
      </p>
    </div>

    <div class="intro-cards">
      <div class="intro-card">
        <div class="intro-card-icon">
          <i class="fa-solid fa-server"></i>
        </div>
        <div class="intro-card-content">
          <span class="intro-card-title">Infrastructure</span>
          <HomelabStatus service="homelab" class="status-inline" />
        </div>
      </div>
      <div class="intro-card">
        <div class="intro-card-icon">
          <i class="fa-solid fa-network-wired"></i>
        </div>
        <div class="intro-card-content">
          <span class="intro-card-title">Services</span>
          <HomelabStatus service="kuma" class="status-inline" />
        </div>
      </div>
    </div>
  </div>

  <div class="intro-highlight">
    <div class="intro-highlight-icon">
      <i class="fa-solid fa-bolt"></i>
    </div>
    <div class="intro-highlight-content">
      <div class="intro-highlight-header">
        <span class="intro-highlight-title">Ideas Are Virtualized</span>
        <a href="https://www.reddit.com/r/homelab/" target="_blank" rel="noopener noreferrer" class="intro-highlight-link">
          r/homelab <i class="fa-solid fa-arrow-up-right-from-square"></i>
        </a>
      </div>
      <p class="intro-highlight-text">
        I run a homelab with over 100 containerized services. I use it to experiment with
        different tools, improve my skills in containerization and automation, and simulate production-like
        setups. It is where I usually test new ideas and figure out what actually works in practice.
      </p>
    </div>
  </div>

  <p class="header-note">
    <i class="fa-solid fa-circle-info"></i>
    Zoom, pan, and explore the full homelab topology. For better experience, use a desktop or laptop device. The diagram is interactive and may take a few seconds to load.
  </p>
</header>
